	(text "CV - controll voltage\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.818 29.972 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "55b9deac-dda0-44c6-90fc-6332263cf688")
	)
	(text "Signal flow\n\nAudio: VCO → VCF → VCA → out.\nControl: pitch CV goes to the VCO's 1V/OCT input, and the gate triggers ADSR 1 (filter) and ADSR 2 (amp).\nOptional: an LFO modulates VCO FM or PWM and the filter cutoff."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.844 69.088 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6e619ede-85a9-40e3-a27a-e71801918054")
	)
	(text "Pitch CVs: the MCU gives each held key to a free VCO, and the quad DAC outputs one 1 V/oct CV per VCO. If you play one note, you can send the same CV to all three for unison.\nGate: one gate line fires both envelopes, so all notes share the same filter and amp envelope (paraphonic).\nMixer: an inverting op-amp summer with a level pot per VCO.\nLFO: shown on the filter only. FM and PWM on the VCOs can be added later.\nPower: ±12 V for the analog side and +5 V or 3.3 V for the MCU and DAC. Use separate regulation and a single-point ground join."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 201.422 -71.374 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8652d1cf-7f91-4634-83b2-68f632ddf312")
	)
	(text "Blocks to build\n\nVCO: a sawtooth core with an exponential converter (matched transistor pair, or a CEM/AS3340 chip).\nVCF: a ladder filter, or a state-variable/OTA filter if you want it simpler.\nVCA: OTA-based, or a V2164/SSM2164.\nEnvelopes and LFO: two ADSRs and one LFO.\nControl: the MCU with a 12-16-bit DAC and op-amp scaling."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 94.742 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a6f20f0b-aa72-40be-9367-831ace053cc7")
	)
	(text "Do the final PCB layout in Altium. Keep analog and digital grounds separate, and use a clean ±12 V supply."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 224.028 19.304 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "bde52873-42e7-4f93-a58b-29a308bd2b87")
	)
	(text "Moritz Klein's YouTube series"
